{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Woe</b> — the sense of <b>they strayed</b> is that they were fleeing. Destruction will come upon them." "<b>But as for me</b> — in my heart and thought, to redeem them. But they would say: 'for all his heart is to do evil to us.'"], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:30.023280122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}